# A stage0 sample from the audit of the self-hosted compiler: Collatz steps
# and digit sums in loops, ending in an exit code the program computes.
collatz is module
collatz purpose "Count Collatz steps and sum digits, exiting with a computed code"
collatz path collatz
collatz imports standard.console
collatz imports standard.math
collatz imports standard.compare
collatz imports standard.convert
collatz exports main

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter purpose "Authority to write lines to standard output"
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout none

steps is operation
steps purpose "The number of Collatz steps from n down to 1"
steps invariant none
steps typeParameter none
steps input n Int64 copied
steps output Int64
steps outputOwnedBy none
steps raises none
steps effect none
steps uses none
steps memoryHeap false
steps async false
steps maxRecursion none
steps label begin loopKind none
steps label begin within none
steps label walk loopKind while
steps label walk within none
steps label walk maxIterations limit
steps label move loopKind none
steps label move within walk
steps label halve loopKind none
steps label halve within walk
steps label triple loopKind none
steps label triple within walk
steps label finished loopKind none
steps label finished within none
steps let value Int64 0 mutable
steps let count Int64 0 mutable
steps let limit Int64 1000 immutable
steps let one Int64 1 immutable
steps let two Int64 2 immutable
steps let zero Int64 0 immutable
steps let three Int64 3 immutable
steps at begin set value n
steps at begin goto walk
steps at walk do oneCheck
steps at walk branch if atOne goto finished else goto move
steps at move do half
steps at move do evenCheck
steps at move do addStep
steps at move set count nextCount
steps at move branch if isEven goto halve else goto triple
steps at halve do divide
steps at halve set value halved
steps at halve goto walk
steps at triple do times
steps at triple do plus
steps at triple set value bumped
steps at triple goto walk
steps at finished return ok count

oneCheck is call
oneCheck in steps
oneCheck invokes compare.lessOrEqualInt64
oneCheck argument left Int64 value copy
oneCheck argument right Int64 one copy
oneCheck result atOne Bool
oneCheck ownedBy none
oneCheck cleanedBy none
oneCheck borrows none
oneCheck catch none
oneCheck suppresses none

half is call
half in steps
half invokes math.remainderInt64
half argument left Int64 value copy
half argument right Int64 two copy
half result rest Int64
half ownedBy none
half cleanedBy none
half borrows none
half catch none
half suppresses none

evenCheck is call
evenCheck in steps
evenCheck invokes compare.equalInt64
evenCheck argument left Int64 rest copy
evenCheck argument right Int64 zero copy
evenCheck result isEven Bool
evenCheck ownedBy none
evenCheck cleanedBy none
evenCheck borrows none
evenCheck catch none
evenCheck suppresses none

addStep is call
addStep in steps
addStep invokes math.addInt64
addStep argument left Int64 count copy
addStep argument right Int64 one copy
addStep result nextCount Int64
addStep ownedBy none
addStep cleanedBy none
addStep borrows none
addStep catch none
addStep suppresses none

divide is call
divide in steps
divide invokes math.divideInt64
divide argument left Int64 value copy
divide argument right Int64 two copy
divide result halved Int64
divide ownedBy none
divide cleanedBy none
divide borrows none
divide catch none
divide suppresses none

times is call
times in steps
times invokes math.multiplyInt64
times argument left Int64 value copy
times argument right Int64 three copy
times result tripled Int64
times ownedBy none
times cleanedBy none
times borrows none
times catch none
times suppresses none

plus is call
plus in steps
plus invokes math.addInt64
plus argument left Int64 tripled copy
plus argument right Int64 one copy
plus result bumped Int64
plus ownedBy none
plus cleanedBy none
plus borrows none
plus catch none
plus suppresses none

digitSum is operation
digitSum purpose "The sum of the decimal digits of a number, by recursion"
digitSum invariant none
digitSum typeParameter none
digitSum input n Int64 copied
digitSum output Int64
digitSum outputOwnedBy none
digitSum raises none
digitSum effect none
digitSum uses none
digitSum memoryHeap false
digitSum async false
digitSum maxRecursion 30
digitSum label begin loopKind none
digitSum label begin within none
digitSum label base loopKind none
digitSum label base within none
digitSum label recurse loopKind none
digitSum label recurse within none
digitSum let ten Int64 10 immutable
digitSum at begin do small
digitSum at begin branch if isSmall goto base else goto recurse
digitSum at base return ok n
digitSum at recurse do lastDigit
digitSum at recurse do shift
digitSum at recurse do inner
digitSum at recurse do total
digitSum at recurse return ok summed

small is call
small in digitSum
small invokes compare.lessThanInt64
small argument left Int64 n copy
small argument right Int64 ten copy
small result isSmall Bool
small ownedBy none
small cleanedBy none
small borrows none
small catch none
small suppresses none

lastDigit is call
lastDigit in digitSum
lastDigit invokes math.remainderInt64
lastDigit argument left Int64 n copy
lastDigit argument right Int64 ten copy
lastDigit result last Int64
lastDigit ownedBy none
lastDigit cleanedBy none
lastDigit borrows none
lastDigit catch none
lastDigit suppresses none

shift is call
shift in digitSum
shift invokes math.divideInt64
shift argument left Int64 n copy
shift argument right Int64 ten copy
shift result rest Int64
shift ownedBy none
shift cleanedBy none
shift borrows none
shift catch none
shift suppresses none

inner is call
inner in digitSum
inner invokes digitSum
inner argument n Int64 rest copy
inner result restSum Int64
inner ownedBy none
inner cleanedBy none
inner borrows none
inner catch none
inner suppresses none

total is call
total in digitSum
total invokes math.addInt64
total argument left Int64 last copy
total argument right Int64 restSum copy
total result summed Int64
total ownedBy none
total cleanedBy none
total borrows none
total catch none
total suppresses none

report is operation
report purpose "Print a label and a number"
report invariant none
report typeParameter none
report input label String borrowed
report input value Int64 copied
report output none
report outputOwnedBy none
report raises none
report effect write console.stdout
report uses stdoutWriter
report memoryHeap false
report async false
report maxRecursion none
report label begin loopKind none
report label begin within none
report label writeLabelDone loopKind none
report label writeLabelDone within none
report label writeValueDone loopKind none
report label writeValueDone within none
report let none
report at begin do writeLabel
report at begin branch ifError writeLabel goto writeLabelDone else goto writeLabelDone
report at writeLabelDone do writeValue
report at writeLabelDone branch ifError writeValue goto writeValueDone else goto writeValueDone
report at writeValueDone return ok none

writeLabel is call
writeLabel rationale "The failure has nowhere to be reported, so it is discarded"
writeLabel in report
writeLabel invokes console.write
writeLabel argument text String label lend
writeLabel result none
writeLabel ownedBy none
writeLabel cleanedBy none
writeLabel borrows none
writeLabel catch writeLabelError console.WriteError
writeLabel suppresses console.WriteError.failed

writeValue is call
writeValue rationale "The failure has nowhere to be reported, so it is discarded"
writeValue in report
writeValue invokes console.writeIntegerLine
writeValue argument value Int64 value copy
writeValue result none
writeValue ownedBy none
writeValue cleanedBy none
writeValue borrows none
writeValue catch writeValueError console.WriteError
writeValue suppresses console.WriteError.failed

main is operation
main purpose "Print Collatz steps for a few numbers and exit with a code computed from them"
main invariant none
main typeParameter none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwnedBy none
main raises none
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memoryHeap false
main async false
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main label each loopKind while
main label each within none
main label each maxIterations top
main label doOne loopKind none
main label doOne within each
main label summary loopKind none
main label summary within none
main let total Int64 0 mutable
main let n Int64 1 mutable
main let top Int64 12 immutable
main let stepsText String "steps: " immutable
main let one Int64 1 immutable
main let totalText String "total: " immutable
main let big Int64 9876543210 immutable
main let digitsText String "digits: " immutable
main let three Int64 3 immutable
main let five Int64 5 immutable
main let powerText String "3^5: " immutable
main let absText String "abs: " immutable
main let n200 Int64 200 immutable
main at begin goto each
main at each do doneCheck
main at each branch if past goto summary else goto doOne
main at doOne do count
main at doOne do reportIt
main at doOne do addIt
main at doOne set total nextTotal
main at doOne do bump
main at doOne set n nextN
main at doOne goto each
main at summary do reportTotal
main at summary do sumDigits
main at summary do reportDigits
main at summary do power
main at summary do reportPower
main at summary do neg
main at summary do absolute
main at summary do reportAbs
main at summary do modCode
main at summary do toCode
main at summary return ok exitCode

doneCheck is call
doneCheck in main
doneCheck invokes compare.greaterThanInt64
doneCheck argument left Int64 n copy
doneCheck argument right Int64 top copy
doneCheck result past Bool
doneCheck ownedBy none
doneCheck cleanedBy none
doneCheck borrows none
doneCheck catch none
doneCheck suppresses none

count is call
count in main
count invokes steps
count argument n Int64 n copy
count result s Int64
count ownedBy none
count cleanedBy none
count borrows none
count catch none
count suppresses none

reportIt is call
reportIt in main
reportIt invokes report
reportIt argument label String stepsText lend
reportIt argument value Int64 s copy
reportIt result none
reportIt ownedBy none
reportIt cleanedBy none
reportIt borrows none
reportIt catch none
reportIt suppresses none

addIt is call
addIt in main
addIt invokes math.addInt64
addIt argument left Int64 total copy
addIt argument right Int64 s copy
addIt result nextTotal Int64
addIt ownedBy none
addIt cleanedBy none
addIt borrows none
addIt catch none
addIt suppresses none

bump is call
bump in main
bump invokes math.addInt64
bump argument left Int64 n copy
bump argument right Int64 one copy
bump result nextN Int64
bump ownedBy none
bump cleanedBy none
bump borrows none
bump catch none
bump suppresses none

reportTotal is call
reportTotal in main
reportTotal invokes report
reportTotal argument label String totalText lend
reportTotal argument value Int64 total copy
reportTotal result none
reportTotal ownedBy none
reportTotal cleanedBy none
reportTotal borrows none
reportTotal catch none
reportTotal suppresses none

sumDigits is call
sumDigits in main
sumDigits invokes digitSum
sumDigits argument n Int64 big copy
sumDigits result ds Int64
sumDigits ownedBy none
sumDigits cleanedBy none
sumDigits borrows none
sumDigits catch none
sumDigits suppresses none

reportDigits is call
reportDigits in main
reportDigits invokes report
reportDigits argument label String digitsText lend
reportDigits argument value Int64 ds copy
reportDigits result none
reportDigits ownedBy none
reportDigits cleanedBy none
reportDigits borrows none
reportDigits catch none
reportDigits suppresses none

power is call
power in main
power invokes math.powerInt64
power argument base Int64 three copy
power argument exponent Int64 five copy
power result p Int64
power ownedBy none
power cleanedBy none
power borrows none
power catch none
power suppresses none

reportPower is call
reportPower in main
reportPower invokes report
reportPower argument label String powerText lend
reportPower argument value Int64 p copy
reportPower result none
reportPower ownedBy none
reportPower cleanedBy none
reportPower borrows none
reportPower catch none
reportPower suppresses none

neg is call
neg in main
neg invokes math.negateInt64
neg argument value Int64 p copy
neg result negated Int64
neg ownedBy none
neg cleanedBy none
neg borrows none
neg catch none
neg suppresses none

