reportAbs cleanedBy none
reportAbs borrows none
reportAbs catch none
reportAbs suppresses none

modCode is call
modCode in main
modCode invokes math.remainderInt64
modCode argument left Int64 total copy
modCode argument right Int64 n200 copy
modCode result code Int64
modCode ownedBy none
modCode cleanedBy none
modCode borrows none
modCode catch none
modCode suppresses none

toCode is call
toCode in main
toCode invokes convert.int64ToExitCode
toCode argument value Int64 code copy
toCode result exitCode ExitCode
toCode ownedBy none
toCode cleanedBy none
toCode borrows none
toCode catch none
